OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhen Steve Monite's electronic
OL,7,     Ffunk album flopped, he buried his
OL,8,     Fmusical ambition. More than three
OL,9,     Fdecades later he was shocked to
OL,10,     Ffind stars like Frank Ocean
OL,11,     Fsinging his songs.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1947, a missing goat led to the
OL,14,     Fdiscovery of the Dead Sea Scrolls.
OL,15,     FThese ancient Jewish manuscripts
OL,16,     Fbecame one of the most important
OL,17,     Farchaeological finds of the 20th
OL,18,     Fcentury.
